{"meta":{"id":"text-tools","category":"it/tools/my-convenience","title":"텍스트 편의 기능","subtitle":"","summary":"변수명 변환(UPPER_SNAKE ↔ camelCase), CSV 템플릿 치환, HTML · JSON 정렬, Base64 · URL 인코딩","tags":["텍스트","camelcase","snake_case","템플릿","json","base64"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"myConvenience","updatedAt":""},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>TEXT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">텍스트 편의 기능</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 변수명 변환(UPPER_SNAKE ↔ camelCase), CSV 템플릿 치환, HTML · JSON 정렬, Base64 · URL 인코딩</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">구성</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">text-main.html 의 탭(라디오)으로 도구를 고르면 iframe 에 해당 HTML 을 불러옵니다. 각 도구 화면에는 기능 설명 · 동작 방식 · 변환 예시가 함께 들어 있습니다.</p><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">도구</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">하는 일</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">변수 변환</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">UPPER_SNAKE ↔ camelCase 토큰 변환, 빈 줄 제거 (결과 자동 클립보드 복사)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">CSV 치환</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">CSV 파일 + 텍스트 템플릿 파일을 읽어 행마다 템플릿 치환 — 일반 모드 / 변환 모드(java ↔ sql)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">HTML 정렬</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">압축된 HTML 을 들여쓰기해서 보기 좋게 정렬</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">JSON 정렬</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">JSON 들여쓰기 정렬 · 검증</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">인코딩 변환</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Base64 · URL 인코딩 / 디코딩</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">실행 화면</h2></div><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/tools/my-convenience/assets/text-tools/01-menu.png\" alt=\"텍스트 편의기능 — 상단 탭으로 도구 선택\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">텍스트 편의기능 — 상단 탭으로 도구 선택</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/tools/my-convenience/assets/text-tools/02-variable.png\" alt=\"변수 변환 — UPPER_SNAKE → camelCase\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">변수 변환 — UPPER_SNAKE → camelCase</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/tools/my-convenience/assets/text-tools/03-csv-template.png\" alt=\"CSV 템플릿 치환 — 일반 / 변환(java ↔ sql) 모드, 폴더 모드\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">CSV 템플릿 치환 — 일반 / 변환(java ↔ sql) 모드, 폴더 모드</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/tools/my-convenience/assets/text-tools/04-json.png\" alt=\"JSON 정렬 · 검증\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">JSON 정렬 · 검증</figcaption></figure></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">변수 변환 — 이름 규칙 바꾸기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">function snakeUpperToLowerCamel(token) {\r\n  // COL_A_B2 -&gt; colAB2\r\n  const parts = token.toLowerCase().split(&#x27;_&#x27;).filter(Boolean);\r\n  if (parts.length === 0) return token;\r\n  return parts[0] + parts.slice(1).map(s =&gt; s.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + s.slice(1)).join(&#x27;&#x27;);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction camelToUpperSnake(token) {\r\n  // colAB2 -&gt; COL_AB2, userID -&gt; USER_ID\r\n  // 대문자 앞, 숫자 앞 경계에 _ 삽입 후 대문자화\r\n  return token\r\n    .replace(/([a-z0-9])([A-Z])/g, &#x27;$1_$2&#x27;)   // aB -&gt; a_B\r\n    .replace(/([A-Za-z])([0-9])/g, &#x27;$1_$2&#x27;)   // a2 -&gt; a_2\r\n    .replace(/([0-9])([A-Za-z])/g, &#x27;$1_$2&#x27;)   // 2a -&gt; 2_a\r\n    .toUpperCase();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction isUpperSnake(s) {\r\n  return /^[A-Z0-9_]+$/.test(s) &amp;&amp; s.includes(&#x27;_&#x27;);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction isCamelLike(s) {\r\n  return /^[a-zA-Z][A-Za-z0-9]*$/.test(s) &amp;&amp; /[A-Z]/.test(s);\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">공백 · 콤마 · 줄바꿈을 구분자로 토큰을 나눠, DB 컬럼명(COL_NAME)과 Java 변수명(colName)을 서로 바꿉니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">빈 줄 제거</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">function removeEmptyLines() {\r\n    const input = document.getElementById(&quot;inputText&quot;).value;\r\n\r\n    // 빈 줄 제거 (공백만 있는 줄도 제거)\r\n    const cleaned = input\r\n        .split(&quot;\\n&quot;)\r\n        .filter(line =&gt; line.trim() !== &quot;&quot;)\r\n        .join(&quot;\\n&quot;);\r\n\r\n    // 결과 출력\r\n    const resultDiv = document.getElementById(&quot;result&quot;);\r\n    resultDiv.textContent = cleaned || &quot;(빈 줄 제거 후 내용 없음)&quot;;\r\n\r\n    // 클립보드에 복사\r\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(cleaned).then(() =&gt; {\r\n    }).catch(err =&gt; {\r\n    });\r\n}</pre></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/tools/my-convenience/text-tools","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"tools","title":"기타 작업물","path":"it/tools"},{"id":"my-convenience","title":"MyConvenience (Electron)","path":"it/tools/my-convenience"}],"hasImage":false}